{"id":52785,"ord":117,"n_segments":125,"prev":52784,"next":52786,"doc":{"id":"67296","title":"67296_Chauncey Morehouse oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Chauncey Morehouse","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/67296/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=67296"},"chapter":"Family, the reunion retold and sound effects","title":"Names and fates of his first wife and children","category":"family_childhood","summary":"Morehouse and Virginia give Evelyn's and the children's names: Jack, born in Detroit, died at eight; James; and Suzy Atherton; Evelyn died in 1965.","period":"1920s-60s","year_from":1920,"year_to":1989,"words":270,"start":[152,0],"end":[154,8],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=67296#s52785","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Detroit","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"Forest Hills","focus":0,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"},{"name":"Long Island","focus":0,"type":"region"}],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Paul Specht Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Paul Specht"}]},"people":[{"name":"James Morehouse","qid":null,"n":8},{"name":"Susan Atherton","qid":null,"n":7},{"name":"Jack Morehouse","qid":null,"n":7},{"name":"Chauncey Morehouse","qid":"Q5088250","n":2},{"name":"Evelyn Morehouse","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Virginia Morehouse","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"One of them","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":43,"theme_name":"Meeting, marrying and raising a family","community":84,"community_name":"Meeting, courting and marrying: musicians' love lives","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":152,"b":0,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"That's the end of the article."},{"p":152,"b":1,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Continuing the conversation now with Virginia and Chauncey. This is the afternoon of the 13th, February 13th."},{"p":152,"b":2,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Let me ask you both about Chauncey's first wife and his children. For the record, could you tell me names."},{"p":152,"b":3,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Sure."},{"p":152,"b":4,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"What was your first wife's name?"},{"p":152,"b":5,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Evelyn."},{"p":152,"b":6,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"You were married to her when you went into the Paul Specht orchestra."},{"p":152,"b":7,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yes."},{"p":152,"b":8,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"And how about your children, can you tell me their names?"},{"p":152,"b":9,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"The children were James."},{"p":152,"b":10,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Jack was the first born."},{"p":152,"b":11,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Jack was the first?"},{"p":152,"b":12,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"The first born in Detroit."},{"p":152,"b":13,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Jack."},{"p":152,"b":14,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Detroit okay. And do you remember about when he was born."},{"p":152,"b":15,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Do you remember the year Jack was born?"},{"p":152,"b":16,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"I don't know."},{"p":152,"b":17,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Now we do have that. That is on a tape."},{"p":153,"b":0,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"On another tape. Okay, we'll find it. Who was the second born?"},{"p":153,"b":1,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Then Sue."},{"p":153,"b":2,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"The second one born?"},{"p":153,"b":3,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Sue is the second child?"},{"p":153,"b":4,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Suzy?"},{"p":153,"b":5,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"No, Suzy was the third."},{"p":153,"b":6,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Oh Jamie. James was the second child."},{"p":153,"b":7,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"James was the second, yes."},{"p":153,"b":8,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"And who was the first?"},{"p":153,"b":9,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Jack."},{"p":153,"b":10,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Jack was first."},{"p":153,"b":11,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":153,"b":12,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Then James, then Suzy."},{"p":153,"b":13,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":153,"b":14,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"One of them died young? Am I wrong?"},{"p":153,"b":15,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Jack died when he was 8 years old."},{"p":153,"b":16,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Okay and Jimmy is - how old would Jimmy be now?"},{"p":153,"b":17,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Jimmy would be, let's see...."},{"p":153,"b":18,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Okay, well about?"},{"p":153,"b":19,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"He's about 46."},{"p":153,"b":20,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"About 46, okay. Where would he be living now? Where is he living?"},{"p":154,"b":0,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"In Long Island."},{"p":154,"b":1,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Long Island, okay. And Suzy lives in Forest Hills."},{"p":154,"b":2,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"She lives in Forest Hills."},{"p":154,"b":3,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"And her last name is Atherton."},{"p":154,"b":4,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Atherton, yes."},{"p":154,"b":5,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"A-t-h-e-r-t-o-n."},{"p":154,"b":6,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":154,"b":7,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Okay. And your wife, Evelyn, died in 1965?"},{"p":154,"b":8,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."}]}